QuickJS 2026-06-04 (github.com/bellard/quickjs, commit 3d5e064e9dd6), MIT licence (LICENSE).
Only the files the engine needs are here (no qjs, qjsc or quickjs-libc: the
std and os modules are left out on purpose, so scripts can only compute).
Changed for RISC OS (riscos.patch):
  - js_def_malloc_usable_size returns 0 on RISC OS: UnixLib defines __GLIBC__
    but has no malloc_usable_size. (So JS_SetMemoryLimit isn't exact there;
    running out of memory still ends in a JavaScript exception.)
  - CONFIG_ATOMICS off on RISC OS (no Atomics.wait, so no pthreads pulled in).
